<h3 id="eth-mining" class="group relative" data-group="true"><a aria-label="eth mining permalink" class="absolute end-full flex h-full items-center opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-100 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100" href="#eth-mining"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link me-1 size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></a>eth_mining</h3>
<p>Returns <code>true</code> if client is actively mining new blocks. This can only return <code>true</code> for proof-of-work networks and may not be available in some clients since <a class="visited:text-primary-visited" href="/roadmap/merge/">The Merge</a>.</p>
<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-label="button-link" data-secondary="false" href="https://ethereum-json-rpc.com/?method=eth_mining" class="relative inline-flex gap-2 items-center justify-center rounded border border-solid [&amp;&gt;svg]:shrink-0 text-primary border-current shadow-none transition-[box-shadow,transform] duration-200 hover-link:!text-primary-hover hover-link:duration-200 hover-link:transition-[box-shadow,transform] focus-visible:outline-primary-hover focus-visible:outline-4 focus-visible:-outline-offset-1 active:text-primary-hover active:shadow-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:text-disabled [&amp;[data-secondary=&#x27;true&#x27;]]:text-body hover-link:shadow-primary-no-blur-1 text-xs min-h-[31px] py-1.5 px-2 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-4 no-underline hover:no-underline [&amp;_[data-label=&#x27;arrow&#x27;]]:ms-0">Try endpoint in playground<span class="sr-only select-none"> <!-- -->(opens in a new tab)</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link ms-1 mb-0.5! inline-block size-[0.875em] max-h-4 max-w-4 shrink-0 rtl:-scale-x-100" aria-hidden="true" data-label="arrow"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a>
<p><strong>Parameters</strong></p>
<p>None</p>
<p><strong>Returns</strong></p>
<p><code>Boolean</code> - returns <code>true</code> if the client is mining, otherwise <code>false</code>.</p>
<p><strong>Example</strong></p>
<div dir="ltr" class="codeblock-shiki group/codeblock relative my-8 has-corner line-numbers"><div data-code-surface="true" class="overflow-auto rounded-md bg-background-highlight text-primary"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark" style="--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD">// Request</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">curl</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676"> -</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">X</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A"> POST</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676"> --</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">data</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77"> '</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D">{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"eth_mining","params":[],"id":71}</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">'</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD">//</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">{</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">  "</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D">id</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">:</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91">71</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">  "</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D">jsonrpc</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D">2.0</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">,</span></span>
