<p>Retrieving the value of pos0 is straightforward:</p>
<div dir="ltr" class="codeblock-shiki group/codeblock relative my-8 has-corner line-numbers"><div data-code-surface="true" class="overflow-auto rounded-md bg-background-highlight text-primary"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark" style="--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">curl</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676"> -</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">X</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A"> POST</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676"> --</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">data</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77"> '</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D">{"jsonrpc":"2.0", "method": "eth_getStorageAt", "params": ["0x295a70b2de5e3953354a6a8344e616ed314d7251", "0x0", "latest"], "id": 1}</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">'</span><span style="--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665"> localhost</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">:</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91">8545</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">{</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D">jsonrpc</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">:</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D">2.0</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">,</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D">id</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">:</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91">1</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">,</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D">result</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">:</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D">0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000004d2</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">}</span></span>
