<p>Returns the number of transactions in a block matching the given block number.</p>
<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-label="button-link" data-secondary="false" href="https://ethereum-json-rpc.com/?method=eth_getBlockTransactionCountByNumber" class="relative inline-flex gap-2 items-center justify-center rounded border border-solid [&amp;&gt;svg]:shrink-0 text-primary border-current shadow-none transition-[box-shadow,transform] duration-200 hover-link:!text-primary-hover hover-link:duration-200 hover-link:transition-[box-shadow,transform] focus-visible:outline-primary-hover focus-visible:outline-4 focus-visible:-outline-offset-1 active:text-primary-hover active:shadow-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:text-disabled [&amp;[data-secondary=&#x27;true&#x27;]]:text-body hover-link:shadow-primary-no-blur-1 text-xs min-h-[31px] py-1.5 px-2 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-4 no-underline hover:no-underline [&amp;_[data-label=&#x27;arrow&#x27;]]:ms-0">Try endpoint in playground<span class="sr-only select-none"> <!-- -->(opens in a new tab)</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link ms-1 mb-0.5! inline-block size-[0.875em] max-h-4 max-w-4 shrink-0 rtl:-scale-x-100" aria-hidden="true" data-label="arrow"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a>
<p><strong>Parameters</strong></p>
<ol class="ms-6 mb-6">
<li class="mb-3 last:mb-0 [&amp;_ol]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:mt-3"><code>QUANTITY|TAG</code> - integer of a block number, or the string <code>&quot;earliest&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;latest&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;pending&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;safe&quot;</code> or <code>&quot;finalized&quot;</code>, as in the <a class="visited:text-primary-visited" href="/developers/docs/apis/json-rpc/#block-parameter">block parameter</a>.</li>
