<p><strong>Returns</strong></p>
<p><code>DATA</code>, 32 Bytes - the transaction hash, or the zero hash if the transaction is not yet available.</p>
<p>Use <a class="visited:text-primary-visited" href="#eth-gettransactionreceipt">eth_getTransactionReceipt</a> to get the contract address, after the transaction was proposed in a block, when you created a contract.</p>
