<h3 id="eth-newblockfilter" class="group relative" data-group="true"><a aria-label="eth newblockfilter permalink" class="absolute end-full flex h-full items-center opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-100 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100" href="#eth-newblockfilter"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link me-1 size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></a>eth_newBlockFilter</h3>
<p>Creates a filter in the node, to notify when a new block arrives.
To check if the state has changed, call <a class="visited:text-primary-visited" href="#eth-getfilterchanges">eth_getFilterChanges</a>.</p>
<p><strong>Parameters</strong>
None</p>
<p><strong>Returns</strong>
<code>QUANTITY</code> - A filter id.</p>
<p><strong>Example</strong></p>
<div dir="ltr" class="codeblock-shiki group/codeblock relative my-8 has-corner line-numbers"><div data-code-surface="true" class="overflow-auto rounded-md bg-background-highlight text-primary"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark" style="--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD">// Request</span></span>
